# API endpoints to monitor — ONE PER LINE, fields separated by |
#
#   <name> | <url> | <Header>: <value>          (header is optional)
#
#   <name>    short label with no spaces — shown in Grafana (e.g. payments-api)
#   <url>     full URL to probe, e.g. https://api.example.com/health
#   <header>  optional auth header sent with the request, e.g.
#                 X-API-Key: abc123
#                 Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOi...
#
# Copy this file to  apis.conf  and edit it:
#     cp blackbox/apis.conf.example blackbox/apis.conf
# Then re-run  bash scripts/deploy.sh
#
# apis.conf is git-ignored because it contains API keys.
# APIs are probed every 60s. A 2xx response = UP; anything else = DOWN.
# Lines starting with # and blank lines are ignored.

payments-api | https://api.example.com/health | X-API-Key: replace-with-real-key
orders-api   | https://orders.example.com/v1/ping | Authorization: Bearer replace-with-token
public-api   | https://status.example.com/health
